  - NodeGUID: 3cd00eaf-05a9-46e6-9d01-d7538ebf5f5b
    DialogueText: "Pek \xE7ok \u015Fey bilirim."
    Position: {x: 1615, y: 421}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 4a181d6e-8490-4635-8494-435a374b4855
    DialogueText: "Sand\u0131\u011F\u0131ndan fazlas\u0131n\u0131 duydum, \xF6\u011Frendim."
    Position: {x: 1633, y: 123}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: acc2f2f4-4292-4d73-ab96-9b4b9c32adb5
    DialogueText: "\u015Eu kap\u0131y\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCyor musun? Oran\u0131n ard\u0131nda
      kadim zamanlardan kalan zindanlar var. Krall\u0131k buray\u0131 kapatt\u0131
      ve kilidini bana verdi. Oysaki ben de burada mahkumdum. O zamandan beridir
      koruyorum buray\u0131. Neden korudu\u011Fumu bile unuttum. Sonra buran\u0131n
      ard\u0131nda bir salg\u0131n ba\u015Flad\u0131. Her yerden mantarlar f\u0131\u015Fk\u0131rmaya
      ba\u015Flad\u0131 o\u011Flum. Gardiyanlar da ka\xE7t\u0131 gitti."
    Position: {x: 2568, y: -60}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
  - NodeGUID: 1c85867e-7323-47e1-91fd-f181e8e2469e
    DialogueText: "Hadi bir anla\u015Fma yapal\u0131m o\u011Flum\u2026 Sen bana istediklerimi
      getir, ben de sana iyi e\u015Fyalar vereyim."
    Position: {x: 2477, y: 406}
    Choices: []
    ReputationChanges: 
    EntryPoint: 0
    IsEndNode: 0
    IsPlayerNode: 0
    CloseDialogAfterThis: 0
